oken authentication.\n- The feature flag hides all agent-related UI when the kagenti-operator component is `Removed` in DSC, and shows it when `Managed`.\n- Federation registration routes the plugin's path prefix to the new sidecar.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- P1: Dashboard integration infrastructure: BFF plugin registration and feature flag for agent views.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":55924,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8f127c29ec6db28","agent_id":"a0c907d57189bb80b","session_id":"472adfce-b32d-4a5d-9a9c-9f6a006f8387","uuid":"a09ca5f9-6a81-4508-9171-a2d948b0a521","timestamp":"2026-10-22T10:58:57.048Z","subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8006"}
