n the kagenti-operator component is `Removed` in DSC, the dashboard hides all agent-related UI elements.\n41\t- Register the plugin in the federation configuration (path prefix to sidecar port mapping).\n42\t- Build with FIPS-compliant Go compilation consistent with the other dashboard BFF binaries.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- The BFF sidecar runs in the dashboard pod on an allocated port with no collision against existing assignments.\n47\t- The BFF serves AgentRuntime CR list/status data from the Kubernetes API for the user's accessible namespaces, with Bearer token authentication.\n48\t- The feature flag hides all agent-related UI when the kagenti-operator component is `Removed` in DSC, and shows it when `Managed`.\n49\t- Federation registration routes the plugin's path prefix to the new sidecar.\n50\t\n51\t## HLR Traceability\n52\t\n53\t- P1: Dashboard integration infrastructure: BFF plugin registration and feature flag for agent views.\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8db2e01fbcd3d520","agent_id":"ae9fc036270642f9d","session_id":"472adfce-b32d-4a5d-9a9c-9f6a006f8387","uuid":"ae57b4fe-c1d0-42c9-b150-d33b29ef576a","timestamp":"2026-10-22T11:06:04.498Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9df4c7fe3b7473e7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
