{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-bb200b764b299afc","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8006-E008\n3\ttitle: Konflux onboarding for AuthBridge sidecar images\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8006\n5\tcomponent: Agentic\n6\tteam: Kagenti\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\timplementation_type: konflux-onboarding\n10\tdependencies:\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E006\n12\t- RHAISTRAT-8006-E005\n13\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8006-E005\n14\tgate_failure_impact:\n15\t  action: add_remediation\n16\t  fallback_approach: If additional AuthBridge variants beyond authbridge-proxy are\n17\t    required for TP, extend the Konflux onboarding scope with one component per added\n18\t    variant; if proxy-only is confirmed, proceed with the single component.\n19\tai_signals:\n20\t  change_specificity: 0\n21\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n22\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n23\t  existing_foundation: 1\n24\t  open_questions: -1\n25\t  external_dependency: -1\n26\t  human_process_gates: -1\n27\t  repo_access: 1\n28\t  architecture_claims: 1\n29\tinvestigation_signals: null\n30\tai_implementability: Medium\n31\tai_implementability_score: 2\n32\tjira_key: null\n33\tbranch: null\n34\t---\n35\t# Konflux onboarding for AuthBridge sidecar images\n36\t\n37\t## Description\n38\t\n39\tOnboards the AuthBridge sidecar image family to the Konflux build pipeline with FIPS-compliant Go compilation, building from the `opendatahub-io/kagenti-extensions` midstream fork. Scope covers the TP variant set confirmed by the variant-selection decision — at minimum the `authbridge-proxy` image, which is the default mode and the committed Tech Preview deliverable.\n40\t\n41\t## Scope\n42\t\n43\t- Submit Konflux onboarding request(s) for the AuthBridge image variants in TP scope (one Konflux component per variant).\n44\t- Convert each variant's Dockerfile to the FIPS-compliant multi-stage Go pattern (`CGO_ENABLED=1`, `GOEXPERIMENT=strictfipsruntime`, UBI9 base), consistent with the other RHOAI Go sidecars.\n45\t- Add `rpms.lock.yaml` and `go.sum` for lockfile pinning.\n46\t- Container security per platform patterns: non-root execution, capability dropping, `seccompProfile.type: RuntimeDefault`; the proxy handles TLS termination and must use FIPS-approved cipher suites.\n47\t- Multi-arch: AMD64 required for TP; arm64 if the pipeline supports it without additional effort.\n48\t\n49\t## Acceptance Criteria\n50\t\n51\t- The AuthBridge proxy sidecar image passes Konflux `check-payload` validation for FIPS compliance.\n52\t- Every variant in the confirmed TP set has a green Konflux build pipeline.\n53\t- Images build for AMD64 (arm64 only if it requires no additional effort).\n54\t- License scan for the dependency tree has passed or findings are resolved.\n55\t\n56\t## HLR Traceability\n57\t\n58\t- P1: AuthBridge proxy sidecar image built via Konflux with FIPS compliance.\n59\t- P2: Multi-arch builds (AMD64 required for TP; arm64 opportunistic).\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-878a4b50fa68aaff","agent_id":"ab480fced7db1da49","session_id":"472adfce-b32d-4a5d-9a9c-9f6a006f8387","uuid":"a1bcc464-e8f1-4fa2-838b-27053d3cacba","timestamp":"2026-10-22T11:17:15.336Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bb200b764b299afc","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
