en the operator and AuthBridge images resolve from the mirrored registry via `RELATED_IMAGE_*` environment variables, measured by the kagenti-operator Deployment running with images from the mirror registry.\n47\t- Pinned image digests for the operator and AuthBridge images are available at bundle assembly time (filled in at execution time from the Konflux-built images; image builds run in parallel and are not a prerequisite for starting this work).\n48\t\n49\t## HLR Traceability\n50\t\n51\t- P1: OLM/CSV packaging with `RELATED_IMAGE_*` entries for disconnected installation.\n52\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-814b0d793f85f566","agent_id":"ae34280954210bdd8","session_id":"472adfce-b32d-4a5d-9a9c-9f6a006f8387","uuid":"ddb9383b-1df5-432c-bb97-eb90e73f1fd2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T11:23:12.182Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9da387d4023a6f7f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-8006 decomposition"}
